{"id":"a19be57eaab9408a","group":"FormalSystem","path":"FormalSystem/912_Monoidal_Logic.md","title":"912 Monoidal Logic","display":"912_Monoidal_Logic","type":"system","metadata":{},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[],"html":"<h1 id=\"912-Monoidal-Logic\">912 Monoidal Logic</h1>\n<p><span class=\"inline-tag\">#FormalSystem</span></p>\n<h1 id=\"1.-原始符号\">1. 原始符号</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\">\\(\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}\\)</span>。公式构造子为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{unit},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{lolli}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{unit},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{lolli}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>第 2 节定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{unit},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{lolli}\">\\(\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{unit},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{lolli}\\)</span> 四个构造子生成的最小闭包。其型别为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{unit}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{unit}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{lolli}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{lolli}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>Monoidal Logic 的目标特征是结构上下文只满足结合律与单位律，不满足交换律。</p>\n<h1 id=\"2.-公式与替换\">2. 公式与替换</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{unit}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{unit}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lolli}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lolli}(A,B)\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义自由原子函数</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\to\\mathcal P(\\mathsf{At})\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>如下：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{atm}(p))=\\{p\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{unit})=\\varnothing,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{unit})=\\varnothing,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{lolli}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{FV}(\\operatorname{lolli}(A,B))=\\operatorname{FV}(A)\\cup\\operatorname{FV}(B).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\">\\(\\sigma:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\)</span>，定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Sub}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>记 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}(A,\\sigma)=A[\\sigma]\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}(A,\\sigma)=A[\\sigma]\\)</span>，满足：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{atm}(p)[\\sigma]=\\sigma(p),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{unit}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{unit},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{unit}[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{unit},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{tensor}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{tensor}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{lolli}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{lolli}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{lolli}(A,B)[\\sigma]=\\operatorname{lolli}(A[\\sigma],B[\\sigma]).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该语言没有绑定构造子。定义有限原子集、绑定名函数与新原子选择函数：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})=\\{F\\subseteq\\mathsf{At}:F\\text{ 为有限集}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{BN}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\to\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At}),\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{BN}(A)=\\varnothing.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(F)\\notin F.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{freshAt}:\\mathcal P_{\\mathrm{fin}}(\\mathsf{At})\\to\\mathsf{At},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{freshAt}(F)\\notin F.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对任一原子重命名 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\">\\(\\rho:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{At}\\)</span>，令</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\times\\mathsf{At}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}:\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\times\\mathsf{At}^{\\mathsf{At}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(A,\\rho)=A[\\sigma_\\rho],\n\\qquad\n\\sigma_\\rho(p)=\\operatorname{atm}(\\rho(p)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\alpha\">\\(\\alpha\\)</span>-等价为句法相等：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Mon}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Mon}}B\\Longleftrightarrow A=B.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>因此 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Sub}\">\\(\\operatorname{Sub}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\">\\(\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\)</span> 均是捕获避免替换。</p>\n<h1 id=\"3.-单子结构上下文\">3. 单子结构上下文</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\">\\(\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\epsilon\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\epsilon\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\Rightarrow\\langle A\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\Rightarrow\\langle A\\rangle\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X,Y\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{comp}(X,Y)\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X,Y\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{comp}(X,Y)\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_m\">\\(\\equiv_m\\)</span> 具有显式型别</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_m\\ \\subseteq\\\n\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\times\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\equiv_m\\ \\subseteq\\\n\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\times\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>它定义为所有满足下列生成式且与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{comp}\">\\(\\operatorname{comp}\\)</span> 相容的等价关系之交。对所有\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\">\\(X,Y,Z\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\)</span>，生成式为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{comp}(\\operatorname{comp}(X,Y),Z)\\equiv_m\\operatorname{comp}(X,\\operatorname{comp}(Y,Z)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{comp}(\\operatorname{comp}(X,Y),Z)\\equiv_m\\operatorname{comp}(X,\\operatorname{comp}(Y,Z)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{comp}(\\epsilon,X)\\equiv_m X,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{comp}(X,\\epsilon)\\equiv_m X.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{comp}(\\epsilon,X)\\equiv_m X,\\qquad\n\\operatorname{comp}(X,\\epsilon)\\equiv_m X.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>同余闭包子句为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\equiv_m X&#39;\\wedge Y\\equiv_m Y&#39;\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{comp}(X,Y)\\equiv_m\\operatorname{comp}(X&#39;,Y&#39;).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\equiv_m X&#39;\\wedge Y\\equiv_m Y&#39;\n\\Rightarrow\n\\operatorname{comp}(X,Y)\\equiv_m\\operatorname{comp}(X&#39;,Y&#39;).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>等价闭包还包括自反、对称与传递闭包；上述交定义使\n<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\equiv_m\">\\(\\equiv_m\\)</span> 成为包含这些生成式的最小等价同余。\n不加入 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{comp}(X,Y)\\equiv_m\\operatorname{comp}(Y,X)\">\\(\\operatorname{comp}(X,Y)\\equiv_m\\operatorname{comp}(Y,X)\\)</span>。</p>\n<h1 id=\"4.-洞、序列与公理\">4. 洞、序列与公理</h1>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\)</span> 是满足下列条件的最小集合：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\Box\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\Box\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{comp}(H,X)\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{comp}(H,X)\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"H\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{comp}(X,H)\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[H\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\n\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{comp}(X,H)\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\Box,X)=X,\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\Box,X)=X,\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{comp}(H,Y),X)=\\operatorname{comp}(\\operatorname{plug}(H,X),Y),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{comp}(H,Y),X)=\\operatorname{comp}(\\operatorname{plug}(H,X),Y),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{comp}(Y,H),X)=\\operatorname{comp}(Y,\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{plug}(\\operatorname{comp}(Y,H),X)=\\operatorname{comp}(Y,\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>序列集合为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}=\\{X\\Rightarrow A:X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}=\\{X\\Rightarrow A:X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}=\\{\\langle A\\rangle\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}=\\{\\langle A\\rangle\\Rightarrow A:A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}=\\{\\epsilon\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{unit}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}=\\{\\epsilon\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{unit}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}=\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{id}}\\cup\\mathsf{Ax}_{I}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"5.-规则关系\">5. 规则关系</h1>\n<p>令 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}^{&lt;\\omega}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\)</span> 为 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\">\\(\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\)</span> 上的有限列集合。以下规则关系均是</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}^{&lt;\\omega}\\times\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>的子集。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes R}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(Y\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{comp}(X,Y)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes R}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(Y\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{comp}(X,Y)\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes L}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{comp}(\\langle A\\rangle,\\langle B\\rangle))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes L}=\\{((\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{comp}(\\langle A\\rangle,\\langle B\\rangle))\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle\\operatorname{tensor}(A,B)\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\multimap R}=\\{((\\operatorname{comp}(X,\\langle A\\rangle)\\Rightarrow B);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lolli}(A,B)):X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\multimap R}=\\{((\\operatorname{comp}(X,\\langle A\\rangle)\\Rightarrow B);X\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{lolli}(A,B)):X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\multimap L}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{comp}(\\langle\\operatorname{lolli}(A,B)\\rangle,X))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\multimap L}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle B\\rangle)\\Rightarrow C);\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\operatorname{comp}(\\langle\\operatorname{lolli}(A,B)\\rangle,X))\\Rightarrow C):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},A,B,C\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{m}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A);Y\\Rightarrow A):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},X\\equiv_m Y\\},\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{m}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A);Y\\Rightarrow A):X,Y\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},X\\equiv_m Y\\},\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle A\\rangle)\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)\\Rightarrow B):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}=\\{((X\\Rightarrow A),(\\operatorname{plug}(H,\\langle A\\rangle)\\Rightarrow B);\\operatorname{plug}(H,X)\\Rightarrow B):H\\in\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},A,B\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes L}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\multimap R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\multimap L}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{m}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}=\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes L}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\multimap R}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\multimap L}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{m}\\cup\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{cut}}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"6.-证明树\">6. 证明树</h1>\n<p>对集合参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch}\">\\(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch}\\)</span>，定义 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Tree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\">\\(\\operatorname{Tree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\)</span> 为以下条件的合取：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"0&lt;|T|&lt;\\omega,\\quad r\\in T,\\quad\\prec\\subseteq T^2,\\quad\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[0&lt;|T|&lt;\\omega,\\quad r\\in T,\\quad\\prec\\subseteq T^2,\\quad\\operatorname{ch}:T\\to T^{&lt;\\omega}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\\prec u\">\\(v\\prec u\\)</span> 表示 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"v\">\\(v\\)</span> 是 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u\">\\(u\\)</span> 的直接子节点。根、父节点、可达性和无环条件为：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists u\\in T\\;(r\\prec u),\\qquad\n\\forall v\\in T\\setminus\\{r\\}\\;\\exists!u\\in T\\;(v\\prec u),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists u\\in T\\;(r\\prec u),\\qquad\n\\forall v\\in T\\setminus\\{r\\}\\;\\exists!u\\in T\\;(v\\prec u),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall v\\in T\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists a:k+1\\to T\\;\n(a(0)=v\\land a(k)=r\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;a(i)\\prec a(i+1)),\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall v\\in T\\;\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N\\;\\exists a:k+1\\to T\\;\n(a(0)=v\\land a(k)=r\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;a(i)\\prec a(i+1)),\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\neg\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists a:k+1\\to T\\;\n(a(0)=a(k)\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;a(i)\\prec a(i+1)).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\neg\\exists k\\in\\mathbb N_{&gt;0}\\;\\exists a:k+1\\to T\\;\n(a(0)=a(k)\\land\\forall i&lt;k\\;a(i)\\prec a(i+1)).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>子列恰好无重复地枚举全部直接子节点：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\forall u\\in T\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\operatorname{ch}(u):n\\to T\\text{ 为单射}\\land\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ch}(u))=\\{v\\in T:v\\prec u\\}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\forall u\\in T\\;\\exists n\\in\\mathbb N\\;\n(\\operatorname{ch}(u):n\\to T\\text{ 为单射}\\land\n\\operatorname{ran}(\\operatorname{ch}(u))=\\{v\\in T:v\\prec u\\}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对集合参数 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\pi,Q\">\\(\\pi,Q\\)</span>，定义：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(\\pi,Q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\land\n\\exists T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell\\;\n\\left[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\pi=(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\land\\operatorname{Tree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\\\\n{}\\land\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\land\\ell(r)=Q\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\left((\\operatorname{ch}(u)=()\\land\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Mon}})\n\\lor(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u),\\ell(u))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\right)\n\\end{array}\\right].\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(\\pi,Q)\n\\Longleftrightarrow Q\\in\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\land\n\\exists T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell\\;\n\\left[\\begin{array}{l}\n\\pi=(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch},\\ell)\\land\\operatorname{Tree}(T,r,\\prec,\\operatorname{ch})\\\\\n{}\\land\\ell:T\\to\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\land\\ell(r)=Q\\\\\n{}\\land\\forall u\\in T\\;\n\\left((\\operatorname{ch}(u)=()\\land\\ell(u)\\in\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Mon}})\n\\lor(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u),\\ell(u))\\in\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\right)\n\\end{array}\\right].\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u)\">\\(\\ell\\circ\\operatorname{ch}(u)\\)</span> 是有序子标号列，本篇规则均为正元，因此空子列只由公理叶分支许可。公理叶和规则节点是许可的两个备选分支，没有开放假设叶。</p>\n<p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\)</span> 定义证明纤维类：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(X,A)\n=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(\\pi,X\\Rightarrow A)\\}.\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(X,A)\n=\\{\\pi:\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(\\pi,X\\Rightarrow A)\\}.\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>这里及以下证明纤维按参数展开为可定义类，成员断言缩写右侧谓词；任意节点重标号的全体不被声明为集合，也不供幂集消费。</p>\n<h1 id=\"7.-可推导性\">7. 可推导性</h1>\n<p>定义</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"X\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Mon}}A\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[X\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Mon}}A\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>当且仅当</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(\\pi,X\\Rightarrow A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\pi\\;\\operatorname{PrfOK}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(\\pi,X\\Rightarrow A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>对 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\">\\(X\\in\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\)</span>、<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\">\\(A\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\)</span> 定义证明证书类与同根证明类：</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(X,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(X,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(X,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(X,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(X,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(X,A).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(X,A)=\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}(X,A).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>单子结构差异对象为</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\n=(\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\equiv_m,\\operatorname{comp},\n\\epsilon,\\mathsf{Rule}_{m},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes R},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\multimap R}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\n=(\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\equiv_m,\\operatorname{comp},\n\\epsilon,\\mathsf{Rule}_{m},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\otimes R},\n\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\multimap R}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h1 id=\"8.-整个形式系统\">8. 整个形式系统</h1>\n<p>以下是元层规格包；证明纤维按本地谓词模式展开，不是将真类作为集合元素的元组。</p>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{Mon}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\operatorname{comp},\\epsilon,\\equiv_m,\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\operatorname{plug},\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathcal S_{\\mathsf{Mon}}=(\\mathsf{At},\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\operatorname{FV},\\operatorname{Sub},\\operatorname{BN},\\operatorname{freshAt},\\operatorname{Ren}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\equiv_\\alpha^{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\mathsf{PreCtx}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\operatorname{comp},\\epsilon,\\equiv_m,\\mathsf{Hole}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\operatorname{plug},\\mathsf{Seq}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\mathsf{Ax}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\mathsf{Rule}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\mathsf{Prf}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\operatorname{Proof}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\mathsf{Cert}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\vdash_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\\mathsf{Delta}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><p>该系统只定义单子上下文上的句法证明关系；不含闭范畴语义或交换结构。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"912-Monoidal-Logic","text":"912 Monoidal Logic","level":1},{"id":"1.-原始符号","text":"1. 原始符号","level":1},{"id":"2.-公式与替换","text":"2. 公式与替换","level":1},{"id":"3.-单子结构上下文","text":"3. 单子结构上下文","level":1},{"id":"4.-洞、序列与公理","text":"4. 洞、序列与公理","level":1},{"id":"5.-规则关系","text":"5. 规则关系","level":1},{"id":"6.-证明树","text":"6. 证明树","level":1},{"id":"7.-可推导性","text":"7. 可推导性","level":1},{"id":"8.-整个形式系统","text":"8. 整个形式系统","level":1}],"links":[],"math":[{"tex":"\\mathsf{At}=\\{p_i:i\\in\\mathbb N\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{unit},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{lolli}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm},\\operatorname{unit},\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{lolli}","display":false},{"tex":"\\operatorname{atm}:\\mathsf{At}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},\n\\qquad\n\\operatorname{unit}\\in\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}},","display":true},{"tex":"\\operatorname{tensor},\\operatorname{lolli}:\n\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\times\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}\\to\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}.","display":true},{"tex":"\\mathsf{Frm}_{\\mathsf{Mon}}","display":false},{"tex":"p\\in\\mathsf{At}\\Rightarrow\\operatorname{atm}(p)\\in\\maths